Z||000000||mrfixit58||04-23-2000||08:36 PM||||Well, I did something this weekend that I didn't think I'd do for a long, long time... I sold my 87 GT.<P>It's not like I set out to do it, but that's the way it just ended up. My Bro-In-Law and I have been talking Fieros for over a year. Like me, he had one years ago and whated another one. He finially decided to buy one for himself. Unfortunatly, the one he wanted was mine. <P>Since I had stored it for over a year and was looking at may a several more months before I was going to get to it, I decided to sell it to him. At least it's still in the family.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Roy<P>||||reg||9
